      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "Studies were included if: (1) NOM with a cast versus removable orthosis after stable type B ankle fractures were compared, (2) included patients were skeletally mature (16 years or older), (3) complications (e.g. DVT, stiffness) and functional outcome measured in Patient Reported Outcome Measures (PROMs) up to 52 weeks were described, (4) available in Dutch, English, or German, (5) original data was reported (no reviews, editorial letters, or expert opinions).",
      "reason": "The manuscript explicitly lists the inclusion criteria, covering the comparison (cast vs. removable orthosis), population (stable type B ankle fractures, skeletally mature), outcomes (complications, functional outcomes), and study types."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "(4) available in Dutch, English, or German, (5) original data was reported (no reviews, editorial letters, or expert opinions).",
