      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "For the secondary outcome, functional outcome, 12 weeks follow-up was considered the most appropriate timing for measuring OMAS.",
      "reason": "The authors identify 12 weeks as the most appropriate timing for the functional outcome (OMAS), indicating prioritization."
    }
  ],
